    "reason": "The changelog line [ev-f810dce8b260] and linked PR #21462 [ev-c9f34cec9d2e] say a new `BearerToken` parameter was added. It lets repository credentials use Bearer Auth instead of Basic Auth, for example for BitBucket Project tokens. The changed files [ev-70dd893b1d3f] (repository_types.go and the repo/repocreds CLI) show this is new and opt-in. So the subject protocol-behavior \"bearer-token-auth\" with change type \"added\" fits. The evidence does not give the exact Secret key or CLI flag spelling, so a more specific subject family cannot be named without guessing.",
